 you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755580/extras/05fe5de64ae20151482f7d317f2d0c07.poster.avif?t=1788315382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755580/extras/05fe5de64ae20151482f7d317f2d0c07.webm?t=1788315382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755580/extras/05fe5de64ae20151482f7d317f2d0c07.mp4?t=1788315382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique artistic style inspired by linoleum engravings, <i>Cursed Frontier</i> immerses you in a dark and fascinating world full of sharp contrasts between light and shadow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Art:</strong> Each level and character is designed using digitized linoleum engravings, creating an unparalleled visual aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story:</strong> Discover the secrets of the Morning Star and the herder's fate in a tale that blends Wild West folklore with themes of redemption and horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Action:</strong> Face a variety of terrifying monsters using classic Wild West weapons and tools like whips, lanterns, and lassos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Explore desolate landscapes with hidden details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Music and Sound:</strong> A melancholic soundtrack accompanies you on this dark journey.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 2D platformer shooter with a somber linoleum-inspired art style, where you’ll face funeral creatures in a haunting Wild West setting.", "supported_languages": "English, Span